@MiniBusiness.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5113

### Create customer
POST {{MiniBusiness.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nguyen Van A",
  "email": "a@example.com"
}

### Get by id
GET {{MiniBusiness.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}

### List (paginated)
GET {{MiniBusiness.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers?page=1&pageSize=10

### Update
PUT {{MiniBusiness.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nguyen Van A Updated",
  "email": "a.updated@example.com"
}

### Deactivate
DELETE {{MiniBusiness.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}

###
